  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparatory study for CSO evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to prepare studies and analyses of relevance for the evaluation of Danish development support for civil society organisations to be carried out 2020-2023. The exact issue to be addressed will be identified in a dialogue between DIIS, the MoFA and relevant CSOs. Possible issues include shrinking space for CSOs, contribution to democratization processes and involvement of women in Danish priority countries.</narrative>
  </description>
